  _displayName: Old Bear of the Pines
  _description: 'The forest''s boss, woken by the Honeycomb Bait sold at Ash''s camp. Charges any hunter within 30 m: 40-damage swipes after a roar, a ground slam every third strike (50 damage all around: jump or get away), a pounce at hunters who keep their distance. 3,000 health; enraged below 40 %. Regains health if everyone runs. Every hunter who hurts it shares the reward.'
